OL,3,ATwo charged over alleged plot to assist
OL,4,AIran in RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British nationals have been charged
OL,7,Fover an alleged plot to assist Iran's
OL,8,Fintelligence service as part of the
OL,9,Finvestigation into the incident at RAF
OL,10,FFairford in September.
OL,12,FMohmed Ahmad Abdulkarim, 24, from
OL,13,FWestminster, has been charged with
OL,14,Fassisting a foreign intelligence
OL,15,Fservice under Section 3 of the National
OL,16,FSecurity Act.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
