OL,3,AMinimum wage set to rise but 18-20
OL,4,Ayear-olds will not get bigger increases
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe minimum wage is set to rise but
OL,7,F18-to-20 year-olds are expected to see
OL,8,Flower increases than in previous years,
OL,9,Fthe BBC understands.
OL,11,FPay for younger workers will rise in
OL,12,Fline with the increase in minimum pay
OL,13,Ffor employees aged 21 years and over.
OL,15,FHowever, the increase for younger
OL,16,Fworkers is lower than that seen in the
OL,17,Fprevious two years, when Labour raised
OL,18,Fthe rate to meet a manifesto promise
OL,19,Fthat it would remove "discriminatory
OL,20,Fage bands" with all adults entitled to
OL,21,Fthe same minimum wage.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
