OL,3,AMinimum wage set to rise but 18-20
OL,4,Ayear-olds will not get bigger increases
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey will reveal the
OL,7,Fnew pay rates in the Budget on
OL,8,FWednesday, while also announcing
OL,9,Fmeasures to give families what he is
OL,10,Fcalling "breathing space" with the cost
OL,11,Fof living.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
