OL,3,AJordan carries out deadly strike in
OL,4,ASyria in retaliation for church attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan said it had co-ordinated with
OL,7,Fthe Syrian government. Syria said it
OL,8,Fhad not been notified of Monday's
OL,9,Fattack.
OL,11,FIt comes after a nine people were
OL,12,Fkilled and 34 injured in a shooting at
OL,13,Fa funeral in a Greek Orthodox church in
OL,14,FKarak on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
